meta {
  name: Get Job By Invite Token
  type: http
  seq: 9
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/jobs/invite/:inviteToken
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:path {
  inviteToken: replace-with-invite-token
}

docs {
  No auth guard on purpose: this is the public endpoint behind the link
  emailed by "Invite To Job" ({FRONTEND_URL}/invite?token=xxx). Lives on
  PublicJobsController (route /jobs/*), same as "Get Shared Job".

  Contract input is { inviteToken } from the path. Looks up a JobInvite
  row whose token matches, status is PENDING, and expiresAt is still in
  the future; returns 500 ("Invalid or expired invitation token")
  otherwise. Returns the underlying job's public fields (no status field,
  same shape as "Get Shared Job").
}
